<section class="activity-score-summary" id="activity-score" aria-labelledby="activityScoreHeading">
<div class="activity-score-heading"><h4 id="activityScoreHeading">All-time activity score</h4><span class="<?php echo $activityScore['has_activity'] ? 'activity-score-number' : 'activity-score-empty'; ?>" data-activity-score="<?php echo $activityScore['score'] === null ? 'unavailable' : $activityScore['score']; ?>"><?php echo $activityScore['score'] === null ? 'Not enough data yet' : $activityScore['score'].'<small>/100</small>'; ?></span></div>
<p><?php echo $activityScore['has_activity'] ? htmlspecialchars($activityScore['label']).'. This combines your saved activity across all time.' : 'Start by saving a task, study session, or check-in. A score will appear when activity is recorded.'; ?></p>
<details><summary>What goes into this score?</summary><ul class="activity-score-parts"><?php foreach($activityScore['parts'] as $name=>$part): ?><li><span><?php echo htmlspecialchars($name); ?><small><?php echo htmlspecialchars($part['basis']); ?></small></span><b><?php echo $part['points']; ?> / <?php echo $part['max']; ?></b></li><?php endforeach; ?></ul>
<p class="activity-score-limit"><?php if($activityScore['has_activity']): ?><?php echo $activityScore['earned']; ?> earned points &divide; <?php echo $activityScore['possible']; ?> possible points &times; 100 = <?php echo $activityScore['score']; ?>/100 (rounded).<?php else: ?>These four components have <?php echo $activityScore['possible']; ?> possible points, converted to a score out of 100 once activity is recorded.<?php endif; ?></p>
<p class="activity-score-limit">Logging delays does not add or remove activity points. Your delay records still support patterns and recommendations. This is an activity summary, not a validated measure of productivity; missing records can affect it. Weekly Reports use a separate score for the selected week.</p></details></section>
